{"seq":1,"slug":"why-haptics","title":"为何触觉反馈：把震动当成一条信息通道","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-haptics-feedback/foundations/why-haptics","wordCount":1816,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"为何触觉反馈-把震动当成一条信息通道\">为何触觉反馈：把震动当成一条信息通道</h1><p>把手指尖压在桌面上慢慢加力，你能在几乎没有视觉变化的情况下分辨出&quot;轻碰、按实、用力按&quot;三个层次——这件事视觉做不到，需要盯着力传感器读数才行。指尖天生就是一台高带宽的力与振动接收器，而游戏长期只把它当成&quot;会不会震&quot;的开关在用。这一篇要论证的核心是：触觉不是视听的附属装饰，而是一条有明确物理带宽、能独立传递信息的反馈通道，值得一个团队为它投入专门的工程预算。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-触觉是有带宽的第三通道\">核心概念：触觉是有带宽的第三通道</h2><p>游戏向玩家输出信息一直主要靠两条通道：视觉与听觉。它们带宽高、空间分辨率好，但都有饱和的时候——屏幕上同时闪十个特效，玩家什么都看不清；战斗音效叠在一起，关键提示被淹没。触觉提供了一条几乎不与前两者抢占注意力资源的并行通道：玩家在看屏幕、听音效的同时，掌心仍能独立地&quot;读&quot;到一记震动，且这条通道有它自己的物理特性。</p>\n<p>下图把三条通道按&quot;何时触发、传什么、谁负责&quot;对照起来，触觉与输入、音频、视觉的边界一目了然。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    GS[游戏状态变化&lt;br/&gt;命中/受击/拾取/警告] --&gt; V[视觉通道&lt;br/&gt;特效/UI/动画]&#10;    GS --&gt; A[听觉通道&lt;br/&gt;音效/音乐]&#10;    GS --&gt; H[触觉通道&lt;br/&gt;振动/阻力]&#10;    IN[玩家输入&lt;br/&gt;按键/扳机] --&gt; GS&#10;    H --&gt; HAND[玩家掌心与指尖]&#10;    V --&gt; EYE[玩家视觉]&#10;    A --&gt; EAR[玩家听觉]&#10;    HAND --&gt; PERCEIVE[多通道融合感知]&#10;    EYE --&gt; PERCEIVE&#10;    EAR --&gt; PERCEIVE\">flowchart TD\n    GS[游戏状态变化&lt;br/&gt;命中/受击/拾取/警告] --&gt; V[视觉通道&lt;br/&gt;特效/UI/动画]\n    GS --&gt; A[听觉通道&lt;br/&gt;音效/音乐]\n    GS --&gt; H[触觉通道&lt;br/&gt;振动/阻力]\n    IN[玩家输入&lt;br/&gt;按键/扳机] --&gt; GS\n    H --&gt; HAND[玩家掌心与指尖]\n    V --&gt; EYE[玩家视觉]\n    A --&gt; EAR[玩家听觉]\n    HAND --&gt; PERCEIVE[多通道融合感知]\n    EYE --&gt; PERCEIVE\n    EAR --&gt; PERCEIVE</pre><p>注意触觉在链路上的位置：它和视觉、听觉一样是游戏状态的输出，与玩家输入是反方向的。输入如何进入游戏是<a href=\"../../game-input-systems/foundations/input-pipeline\">输入系统</a>的领域，本 hub 只关心输出回掌心这一侧。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>通道</th>\n<th>典型延迟容忍</th>\n<th>空间分辨率</th>\n<th>注意力占用</th>\n<th>在嘈杂场景的鲁棒性</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>视觉</td>\n<td>较低（需即时）</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>高（须看屏幕）</td>\n<td>差（特效互相遮蔽）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>听觉</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>中（双耳定位）</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>差（音效叠加掩蔽）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>触觉</td>\n<td>低（须 &lt; 约 50ms 才贴脸）</td>\n<td>低（左右手两点）</td>\n<td>低（被动接收）</td>\n<td>好（很少互相掩蔽）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这张表解释了触觉的工程价值：它在&quot;嘈杂场景鲁棒性&quot;和&quot;注意力占用&quot;两栏上恰好补上视听的短板。当屏幕和音箱都过载时，掌心那一记震动仍然清晰。</p>\n<h2 id=\"指尖能感知什么-机械感受器与频率响应\">指尖能感知什么：机械感受器与频率响应</h2><p>要知道触觉这条通道能传多少信息，得看接收端的物理极限。人手掌与指尖皮肤下有四类机械感受器，各自对不同频率的振动敏感，这直接决定了触觉作动器应该工作在哪个频段。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>帕奇尼小体（Pacinian）</strong>：对 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>200</mn><mtext>–</mtext><mn>300</mn><mtext> </mtext><mtext>Hz</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">200\\text{–}300\\,\\text{Hz}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">200</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">–</span></span><span class=\"mord\">300</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Hz</span></span></span></span></span></span> 的高频振动最敏感，是感知&quot;高清纹理&quot;和细腻颗粒感的主力，DualSense 音圈作动器能造的细腻触感正是打在这个频段。</li>\n<li><strong>梅斯纳小体（Meissner）</strong>：对 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>20</mn><mtext>–</mtext><mn>50</mn><mtext> </mtext><mtext>Hz</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">20\\text{–}50\\,\\text{Hz}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">20</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">–</span></span><span class=\"mord\">50</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Hz</span></span></span></span></span></span> 的低频敏感，负责感知打滑、轻拍这类瞬态。</li>\n<li><strong>梅克尔细胞与鲁菲尼末梢</strong>：响应静态压力与皮肤拉伸，对应自适应扳机那种&quot;持续阻力&quot;而非振动。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>人手对振动的整体敏感频段大约在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>20</mn><mtext>–</mtext><mn>1000</mn><mtext> </mtext><mtext>Hz</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">20\\text{–}1000\\,\\text{Hz}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">20</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">–</span></span><span class=\"mord\">1000</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Hz</span></span></span></span></span></span>，峰值敏感度落在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>200</mn><mtext> </mtext><mtext>Hz</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">200\\,\\text{Hz}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">200</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Hz</span></span></span></span></span></span> 附近。这意味着一个只能输出单一固定频率的偏心转子马达（ERM），物理上就无法触及帕奇尼小体负责的细腻区间——这正是 ERM 和音圈作动器体验天差地别的根因，作动器的具体差异在<a href=\"haptic-hardware\">触觉硬件</a>详述。</p>\n<h2 id=\"强度的信息上限-韦伯-费希纳定律\">强度的信息上限：韦伯-费希纳定律</h2><p>触觉能传几档可分辨的强度？这受韦伯定律支配：人对刺激强度变化的最小可分辨差异（JND）与基准强度成正比。写成关系式：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>I</mi></mrow><mi>I</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{\\Delta I}{I} = k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span></span></span></span></span> 是当前振动强度，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>I</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta I</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span></span></span></span></span> 是恰好能被分辨出的强度增量，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 是常数（触觉振幅的韦伯分数大约在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.1</mn><mtext>–</mtext><mn>0.2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.1\\text{–}0.2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.1</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">–</span></span><span class=\"mord\">0.2</span></span></span></span></span>）。这条定律有两个对设计极其重要的推论。</p>\n<p>第一，可分辨的强度档位是有限的。从最弱可感到最强不刺痛，按 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>≈</mo><mn>0.15</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k\\approx0.15</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.15</span></span></span></span></span> 的几何级数排，中间大约只能塞下七到十档清晰可辨的强度。所以试图用&quot;震动强度&quot;编码一个连续数值（比如血量百分比）注定失败——玩家分不出 62% 和 68% 的震动差别。</p>\n<p>第二，感知是对数压缩的。费希纳由韦伯定律积分得到感知强度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span> 与物理强度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span></span></span></span></span> 的对数关系：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mfrac><mi>I</mi><msub><mi>I</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P = c \\cdot \\ln\\!\\frac{I}{I_0}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4445em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1963em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">ln</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>I</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是感知阈值。这意味着把物理振幅翻倍，主观强度只增加一个固定量。设计强度曲线时必须按对数（或近似按响度的方式）映射，线性映射会让弱档挤成一团、强档浪费动态范围。如何把这条曲线工程化，是<a href=\"haptic-signal-model\">触觉信号模型</a>的内容。</p>\n<h2 id=\"触觉创造了什么价值-确认-预告与具身\">触觉创造了什么价值：确认、预告与具身</h2><p>把上面的物理约束落到玩家体验上，触觉真正能创造的价值集中在三件事，而不是笼统的&quot;沉浸感&quot;。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>操作确认（confirmation）</strong>：开火、换弹、拾取成功时给一记短促瞬态，玩家无需看 UI 就知道操作生效了。这是延迟最敏感的用途，震动若晚于动作超过约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>50</mn><mtext> </mtext><mtext>ms</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">50\\,\\text{ms}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">50</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">ms</span></span></span></span></span></span> 就会&quot;脱节&quot;。</li>\n<li><strong>状态预告（telegraphing）</strong>：Boss 蓄力、背后脚步、扳机扣到临界点，用触觉提前一拍预告，给玩家反应窗口。这条用途利用了触觉&quot;不被视听掩蔽&quot;的鲁棒性，与玩法的深度绑定见<a href=\"../practice/haptics-gameplay\">触觉与玩法绑定</a>。</li>\n<li><strong>具身材质感（embodiment）</strong>：在泥地和铁板上行走给不同质感的连续震动，让虚拟世界获得物理实在感。这是高清触觉相对 ERM 的最大增量，也最依赖<a href=\"../design/haptic-design-language\">触觉设计语言</a>的系统化。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>这三类价值的共同点是：它们都把触觉当作传递特定信息的手段，而不是&quot;让玩家爽一下&quot;的调味剂。一旦明确了要传什么信息，强度、频率、时长就都有了客观的设计依据，而不是凭感觉调参。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>触觉是与视听并列的第三条信息通道，其独特优势是注意力占用低、在嘈杂场景下不易被掩蔽。</li>\n<li>指尖机械感受器决定触觉有效频段约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>20</mn><mtext>–</mtext><mn>1000</mn><mtext> </mtext><mtext>Hz</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">20\\text{–}1000\\,\\text{Hz}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">20</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">–</span></span><span class=\"mord\">1000</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Hz</span></span></span></span></span></span>、峰值在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>200</mn><mtext> </mtext><mtext>Hz</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">200\\,\\text{Hz}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">200</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Hz</span></span></span></span></span></span>，单频 ERM 物理上够不到细腻区间。</li>\n<li>韦伯-费希纳定律决定可分辨强度只有七到十档且感知呈对数压缩，因此触觉不适合编码连续数值，强度曲线须按对数映射。</li>\n<li>触觉的真实价值是操作确认、状态预告、具身材质感三类信息传递，明确&quot;传什么&quot;才能客观地调参。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>作动器如何决定可达频段：<a href=\"haptic-hardware\">触觉硬件</a></li>\n<li>把上述物理约束工程化为可计算信号：<a href=\"haptic-signal-model\">触觉信号模型</a></li>\n<li>触觉作为玩法信息的深度用法：<a href=\"../practice/haptics-gameplay\">触觉与玩法绑定</a></li>\n<li>跨库：触觉只是众多反馈通道之一，整体反馈原则见 <a href=\"../../game-ui-ux/foundations/player-feedback\">玩家反馈</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"为何触觉反馈：把震动当成一条信息通道","id":"为何触觉反馈-把震动当成一条信息通道"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：触觉是有带宽的第三通道","id":"核心概念-触觉是有带宽的第三通道"},{"level":2,"text":"指尖能感知什么：机械感受器与频率响应","id":"指尖能感知什么-机械感受器与频率响应"},{"level":2,"text":"强度的信息上限：韦伯-费希纳定律","id":"强度的信息上限-韦伯-费希纳定律"},{"level":2,"text":"触觉创造了什么价值：确认、预告与具身","id":"触觉创造了什么价值-确认-预告与具身"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":null,"next":{"title":"触觉硬件：从偏心转子到音圈与可编程阻力","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-haptics-feedback/foundations/haptic-hardware"}}